  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study solid waste, biomass and other circular economy opportunities in South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This study will provide an overview of private sector, investment and development opportunities for circular economy initiatives in South Africa. In this project, these identified opportunities will be translated into concrete leads for cooperation and matches between South African and Dutch companies in the following sub-sectors: &#x2022;	Solid waste management chain &#x2022;	Biomass (e.g. biogas)&#x2022;	Plastics &#x2022;	Building and construction&#x2022;	Circular use of water</narrative>
  </description>
